---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Your information, considered" description="How this fictional clinic demo handles forms, local assets and personal information.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="PRIVACY / DEMO INFORMATION" title="Clear about" accent="your information."/>
  <article class="container section-pad max-prose prose">
    <h2>A demonstration, with <em>local interactions.</em>
    </h2>
    <p>This website is a sales showcase for a fictional clinic. It does not provide dental care, real appointments or a secure patient messaging service.</p>
    <h2>Forms and your details.</h2>
    <p>Booking and contact form values remain in page memory while you use the demo. They are not transmitted to a clinic, emailed, stored in a database or saved in browser storage. Reloading or leaving the page clears them. Please use invented sample details rather than personal or medical information.</p>
    <h2>Fonts, artwork and tracking.</h2>
    <p>Fonts, SVG artwork and application scripts are served with the website. The project includes no analytics, advertising scripts, tracking cookies or external map embeds. The hosting service used to run it may maintain ordinary server logs.</p>
    <h2>Links outside the demo.</h2>
    <p>Phone, email, WhatsApp, reference and social links can open other apps or websites. Those services have their own privacy practices. All clinic contact details here are placeholders.</p>
    <h2>Before this becomes a real clinic site.</h2>
    <p>Replace this page with a privacy notice appropriate to the actual practice, hosting, form provider, jurisdiction and data flows. Connect a suitable booking provider, confirm security and retention requirements, obtain consent for patient images, and replace all fictional claims and contact details.</p>
    <p class="illustrative-note">Demo notice updated 29 October 2026.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
